From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EleDIY <noreply@example.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: move 32MiB script address below reserved memory

On the 32 MiB Lichee Pi Nano, U-Boot 2026.01 relocates into the area
containing the default script address at SDRAM + 0x1d40000. The LMB
check consequently rejects boot.scr before it can be executed.

Place the small boot script at SDRAM + 0x0f00000. This is below the
relocated U-Boot reservation and does not overlap this board's kernel
or devicetree load addresses.
---
 include/configs/sunxi-common.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/include/configs/sunxi-common.h
+++ b/include/configs/sunxi-common.h
@@ -124,7 +124,7 @@
 #define BOOTM_SIZE        __stringify(0x1700000)
 #define KERNEL_ADDR_R     __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1000000))
 #define FDT_ADDR_R        __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1d50000))
-#define SCRIPT_ADDR_R     __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1d40000))
+#define SCRIPT_ADDR_R     __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(0f00000))
 #define PXEFILE_ADDR_R    __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1d00000))
 #define FDTOVERLAY_ADDR_R __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1d20000))
 #define RAMDISK_ADDR_R    __stringify(SDRAM_OFFSET(1800000))
--
2.39.5
